      { "id": "world",   "label": "World",   "emoji": "🌍", "radius_km": 0 }
    ],
    "_doc_routing": "Route geometry + per-mode distance/time. valhalla_public = FOSSGIS Valhalla (free, no key, fair-use) — real road routes for car/walk/bike/bus. boat/flight/swim have no router → great-circle estimate. Consumed by MapsRouting (baked UI_ROUTING_ENDPOINT).",
